msgstr "Katta sartarosh"

#: .\templates\client\general\about.html:124
msgid ""
"Specializing in classic cuts and hot towel shaves, Michael delivers "
"precision with every service."
msgstr ""
"Klassik soch turmaklari va issiq sochiq bilan soqol olish bo‘yicha "
"mutaxassis Michael har bir xizmatda aniq natija taqdim etadi."

#: .\templates\client\general\about.html:142
msgid "James Wilson"
msgstr "James Wilson"

#: .\templates\client\general\about.html:143
msgid "Style Specialist"
msgstr "Uslub mutaxassisi"

#: .\templates\client\general\about.html:144
msgid ""
"With an eye for modern trends, James helps clients achieve their perfect "
"contemporary look."
msgstr ""
"Zamonaviy tendentsiyalarni bilgan James mijozlarga mukammal zamonaviy "
