#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:244
msgid ""
"We're conveniently located just a short walk from Amir Temur Square. Come in "
"for a consultation or your next premium cut."
msgstr ""
"Biz Amir Temur maydonidan qisqa yurish masofasida joylashganmiz. "
"Maslahatlashish yoki navbatdagi premium sochingiz uchun tashrif buyuring."

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:251
msgid "Nearest metro station: Abdulla Qodiriy Metro Station (Line Circle)"
msgstr "Eng yaqin metro bekati: Abdulla Qodiriy metro bekati (Aylana liniyasi)"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:255
msgid "Multiple bus stops nearby on Amir Temur Street"
msgstr "Amir Temur ko‘chasida bir nechta avtobus to‘xtash joylari"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:259
msgid ""
"Public parking available at Amir Temur Street Parking Garage, 2-minute walk"
msgstr ""
"Amir Temur ko‘chasidagi to‘xtash joyida jamoat uchun avtoturargoh, 2 "
"daqiqalik piyoda masofa"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:263
msgid "Get Directions"
msgstr "Yo‘l ko‘rsatmalarini olish"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:274
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Tez-tez beriladigan savollar"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:275
msgid "Quick answers to common questions"
msgstr "Ommabop savollarga tezkor javoblar"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:286
msgid "Do I need to book an appointment?"
msgstr "Menga uchrashuv belgilash kerakmi?"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:291
msgid ""
"While we welcome walk-ins when possible, we strongly recommend booking an "
"appointment to ensure you get your preferred barber and time slot. You can "
"book online through our website, by phone, or using our mobile app."
msgstr ""
"Qo‘shimcha ravishda, uchrashuvni oldindan belgilashni tavsiya qilamiz, "
"shunda siz o‘zingiz yoqtirgan sartarosh va vaqtni olasiz. Uchrashuvni "
"saytimiz, telefon yoki mobil ilovamiz orqali belgilashingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:301
msgid "What payment methods do you accept?"
msgstr "Qanday to‘lov usullarini qabul qilasiz?"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:306
msgid ""
"We accept all major credit cards, debit cards, mobile payments (Apple Pay, "
"Google Pay), and cash. We also offer gift cards that can be purchased in-"
"store or online."
msgstr ""
"Biz barcha asosiy kredit va debet kartalarini, mobil to‘lovlarni (Apple Pay, "
"Google Pay) va naqd pulni qabul qilamiz. Shuningdek, do‘konda yoki onlayn "
"tarzda sotib olinadigan sovg‘a kartalarimiz mavjud."

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:316
msgid "How early should I arrive for my appointment?"
msgstr "Uchrashuvga qancha oldin kelishim kerak?"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:321
msgid ""
"We recommend arriving 5-10 minutes before your scheduled appointment time. "
"This allows you to check in, enjoy a complimentary beverage, and relax "
"before your service begins."
msgstr ""
"Uchrashuvdan 5-10 daqiqa oldin kelishingizni tavsiya qilamiz. Bu vaqt "
"ro‘yxatdan o‘tish, bepul ichimlikdan bahramand bo‘lish va xizmat "
"boshlanishidan oldin dam olish uchun yetarli."

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:331
msgid "What if I need to cancel or reschedule?"
msgstr ""
"Agar bekor qilish yoki qayta belgilash kerak bo‘lsa nima qilishim kerak?"

#: .\templates\client\general\contact-us.html:336
msgid ""
"We understand that plans change. We kindly ask for at least 24 hours' notice "
"for cancellations or rescheduling. You can make these changes through our "
"online booking system, mobile app, or by calling us directly."
msgstr ""
"Rejalar o‘zgarishi mumkinligini tushunamiz. Bekor qilish yoki qayta "
